{"duration": 344.7666875, "segments": [{"start": 0.34, "end": 6.56, "text": "A commentary on a travel video by Ryan Van Duser, licensed Creative Commons attribution.", "words": [[0.34, 0.88, " A"], [0.88, 1.44, " commentary"], [1.44, 1.66, " on"], [1.66, 1.86, " a"], [1.86, 2.1, " travel"], [2.1, 2.52, " video"], [2.52, 2.74, " by"], [2.74, 3.08, " Ryan"], [3.08, 3.36, " Van"], [3.36, 3.96, " Duser,"], [4.4, 4.66, " licensed"], [4.66, 5.32, " Creative"], [5.32, 5.68, " Commons"], [5.68, 6.56, " attribution."]]}, {"start": 7.06, "end": 11.08, "text": "We watch seven seconds of each place, and then check what it really looks like.", "words": [[7.06, 7.26, " We"], [7.26, 7.54, " watch"], [7.54, 7.92, " seven"], [7.92, 8.24, " seconds"], [8.24, 8.4, " of"], [8.4, 8.62, " each"], [8.62, 8.96, " place,"], [9.3, 9.42, " and"], [9.42, 9.64, " then"], [9.64, 9.82, " check"], [9.82, 9.96, " what"], [9.96, 10.16, " it"], [10.16, 10.38, " really"], [10.38, 10.64, " looks"], [10.64, 11.08, " like."]]}, {"start": 22.23, "end": 25.77, "text": "The clip shows close-ups of peaks, a small lake and prayer flags.", "words": [[22.23, 22.41, " The"], [22.41, 22.57, " clip"], [22.57, 22.87, " shows"], [22.87, 23.17, " close"], [23.17, 23.31, "-ups"], [23.31, 23.53, " of"], [23.53, 23.73, " peaks,"], [24.11, 24.35, " a"], [24.35, 24.59, " small"], [24.59, 24.85, " lake"], [24.85, 25.07, " and"], [25.07, 25.31, " prayer"], [25.31, 25.77, " flags."]]}, {"start": 26.45, "end": 33.23, "text": "This is Ama Dablem, 6,812 meters high, which for several days dominates the eastern", "words": [[26.45, 26.75, " This"], [26.75, 27.09, " is"], [27.09, 27.33, " Ama"], [27.33, 27.85, " Dablem,"], [28.31, 28.81, " 6"], [28.81, 29.65, ",812"], [29.65, 30.03, " meters"], [30.03, 30.39, " high,"], [30.81, 31.01, " which"], [31.01, 31.27, " for"], [31.27, 31.55, " several"], [31.55, 31.99, " days"], [31.99, 32.59, " dominates"], [32.59, 32.83, " the"], [32.83, 33.23, " eastern"]]}, {"start": 33.23, "end": 36.07, "text": "sky for anyone trekking to Everest base camp.", "words": [[33.23, 33.65, " sky"], [33.65, 34.03, " for"], [34.03, 34.37, " anyone"], [34.37, 34.77, " trekking"], [34.77, 35.03, " to"], [35.03, 35.37, " Everest"], [35.37, 35.73, " base"], [35.73, 36.07, " camp."]]}, {"start": 36.55, "end": 42.75, "text": "And these are the Gokyo Lakes in Sagarmatha National Park, at an elevation of 4,700 to", "words": [[36.55, 36.85, " And"], [36.85, 37.19, " these"], [37.19, 37.45, " are"], [37.45, 37.65, " the"], [37.65, 37.99, " Gokyo"], [37.99, 38.35, " Lakes"], [38.35, 38.65, " in"], [38.65, 39.27, " Sagarmatha"], [39.27, 39.75, " National"], [39.75, 40.15, " Park,"], [40.57, 40.69, " at"], [40.69, 40.85, " an"], [40.85, 41.31, " elevation"], [41.31, 41.63, " of"], [41.63, 41.89, " 4"], [41.89, 42.41, ",700"], [42.41, 42.75, " to"]]}, {"start": 42.75, "end": 43.91, "text": "5,000 meters.", "words": [[42.75, 43.11, " 5"], [43.11, 43.47, ",000"], [43.47, 43.91, " meters."]]}, {"start": 44.59, "end": 46.67, "text": "Look at the two tiny figures on the slope.", "words": [[44.59, 44.75, " Look"], [44.75, 44.91, " at"], [44.91, 45.07, " the"], [45.07, 45.29, " two"], [45.29, 45.65, " tiny"], [45.65, 46.01, " figures"], [46.01, 46.21, " on"], [46.21, 46.41, " the"], [46.41, 46.67, " slope."]]}, {"start": 47.07, "end": 49.15, "text": "That is the real scale of this landscape.", "words": [[47.07, 47.31, " That"], [47.31, 47.51, " is"], [47.51, 47.69, " the"], [47.69, 47.97, " real"], [47.97, 48.27, " scale"], [48.27, 48.41, " of"], [48.41, 48.61, " this"], [48.61, 49.15, " landscape."]]}, {"start": 60.68, "end": 64.36, "text": "This window shows trekkers and a camp, but not the citadel itself.", "words": [[60.68, 60.98, " This"], [60.98, 61.32, " window"], [61.32, 61.64, " shows"], [61.64, 62.12, " trekkers"], [62.12, 62.28, " and"], [62.28, 62.46, " a"], [62.46, 62.66, " camp,"], [62.88, 63.14, " but"], [63.14, 63.4, " not"], [63.4, 63.52, " the"], [63.52, 63.84, " citadel"], [63.84, 64.36, " itself."]]}, {"start": 65.0, "end": 67.32, "text": "This is what Machu Picchu really looks like.", "words": [[65.0, 65.22, " This"], [65.22, 65.42, " is"], [65.42, 65.66, " what"], [65.66, 66.02, " Machu"], [66.02, 66.3, " Picchu"], [66.3, 66.58, " really"], [66.58, 66.84, " looks"], [66.84, 67.32, " like."]]}, {"start": 67.64, "end": 72.0, "text": "Stone terraces and houses on a ridge, with the peak behind them, often wrapped", "words": [[67.64, 67.98, " Stone"], [67.98, 68.52, " terraces"], [68.52, 68.72, " and"], [68.72, 69.08, " houses"], [69.08, 69.34, " on"], [69.34, 69.48, " a"], [69.48, 69.74, " ridge,"], [70.06, 70.14, " with"], [70.14, 70.34, " the"], [70.34, 70.52, " peak"], [70.52, 70.86, " behind"], [70.86, 71.18, " them,"], [71.42, 71.72, " often"], [71.72, 72.0, " wrapped"]]}, {"start": 72.0, "end": 72.56, "text": "in cloud.", "words": [[72.0, 72.3, " in"], [72.3, 72.56, " cloud."]]}, {"start": 73.08, "end": 79.06, "text": "A photograph from Hiram Bingham's expedition in 1912 shows the same place as a field", "words": [[73.08, 73.38, " A"], [73.38, 73.94, " photograph"], [73.94, 74.18, " from"], [74.18, 74.5, " Hiram"], [74.5, 75.12, " Bingham's"], [75.12, 75.7, " expedition"], [75.7, 75.98, " in"], [75.98, 77.02, " 1912"], [77.02, 77.48, " shows"], [77.48, 77.76, " the"], [77.76, 78.06, " same"], [78.06, 78.46, " place"], [78.46, 78.66, " as"], [78.66, 78.88, " a"], [78.88, 79.06, " field"]]}, {"start": 79.06, "end": 83.64, "text": "of rubble, before the restoration of 1929 to 1971.", "words": [[79.06, 79.26, " of"], [79.26, 79.66, " rubble,"], [79.98, 80.28, " before"], [80.28, 80.52, " the"], [80.52, 81.02, " restoration"], [81.02, 81.3, " of"], [81.3, 82.24, " 1929"], [82.24, 82.64, " to"], [82.64, 83.64, " 1971."]]}, {"start": 84.38, "end": 90.66, "text": "Today the citadel admits up to 4,500 visitors a day, and up to 5,600 in peak season.", "words": [[84.38, 84.62, " Today"], [84.62, 84.84, " the"], [84.84, 85.36, " citadel"], [85.36, 85.7, " admits"], [85.7, 85.98, " up"], [85.98, 86.24, " to"], [86.24, 86.44, " 4"], [86.44, 86.96, ",500"], [86.96, 87.48, " visitors"], [87.48, 87.72, " a"], [87.72, 87.96, " day,"], [88.38, 88.52, " and"], [88.52, 88.68, " up"], [88.68, 88.96, " to"], [88.96, 89.16, " 5"], [89.16, 89.66, ",600"], [89.66, 90.06, " in"], [90.06, 90.26, " peak"], [90.26, 90.66, " season."]]}, {"start": 102.0, "end": 106.22, "text": "The clip shows two cyclists on a dirt road, with a red mesa behind them.", "words": [[102.0, 102.18, " The"], [102.18, 102.34, " clip"], [102.34, 102.64, " shows"], [102.64, 102.98, " two"], [102.98, 103.48, " cyclists"], [103.48, 103.64, " on"], [103.64, 103.78, " a"], [103.78, 103.94, " dirt"], [103.94, 104.32, " road,"], [104.64, 104.78, " with"], [104.78, 104.96, " a"], [104.96, 105.16, " red"], [105.16, 105.48, " mesa"], [105.48, 105.86, " behind"], [105.86, 106.22, " them."]]}, {"start": 106.72, "end": 110.02, "text": "This is the White Rim Road in Canyonlands National Park.", "words": [[106.72, 106.96, " This"], [106.96, 107.14, " is"], [107.14, 107.4, " the"], [107.4, 107.66, " White"], [107.66, 107.82, " Rim"], [107.82, 108.18, " Road"], [108.18, 108.48, " in"], [108.48, 109.06, " Canyonlands"], [109.06, 109.56, " National"], [109.56, 110.02, " Park."]]}, {"start": 110.02, "end": 115.12, "text": "71 miles, about 115 kilometers, of unpaved road.", "words": [[110.02, 110.92, " 71"], [110.92, 111.58, " miles,"], [111.8, 112.12, " about"], [112.12, 112.78, " 115"], [112.78, 113.56, " kilometers,"], [113.96, 114.2, " of"], [114.2, 114.76, " unpaved"], [114.76, 115.12, " road."]]}, {"start": 115.8, "end": 121.18, "text": "It was built in the 1950s below the island in the Sky Mesa, so that prospectors could", "words": [[115.8, 115.88, " It"], [115.88, 116.08, " was"], [116.08, 116.32, " built"], [116.32, 116.5, " in"], [116.5, 116.6, " the"], [116.6, 117.58, " 1950s"], [117.58, 117.9, " below"], [117.9, 118.18, " the"], [118.18, 118.5, " island"], [118.5, 118.72, " in"], [118.72, 118.92, " the"], [118.92, 119.14, " Sky"], [119.14, 119.74, " Mesa,"], [120.0, 120.12, " so"], [120.12, 120.32, " that"], [120.32, 120.96, " prospectors"], [120.96, 121.18, " could"]]}, {"start": 121.18, "end": 122.66, "text": "reach uranium deposits.", "words": [[121.18, 121.46, " reach"], [121.46, 122.06, " uranium"], [122.06, 122.66, " deposits."]]}, {"start": 123.38, "end": 128.1, "text": "And this is the same country from above, at the Green River Overlook, where the river", "words": [[123.38, 123.58, " And"], [123.58, 123.8, " this"], [123.8, 124.0, " is"], [124.0, 124.18, " the"], [124.18, 124.44, " same"], [124.44, 124.8, " country"], [124.8, 125.06, " from"], [125.06, 125.46, " above,"], [125.76, 125.86, " at"], [125.86, 126.1, " the"], [126.1, 126.3, " Green"], [126.3, 126.66, " River"], [126.66, 127.18, " Overlook,"], [127.54, 127.68, " where"], [127.68, 127.84, " the"], [127.84, 128.1, " river"]]}, {"start": 128.1, "end": 129.98, "text": "winds through canyons far below.", "words": [[128.1, 128.46, " winds"], [128.46, 128.76, " through"], [128.76, 129.28, " canyons"], [129.28, 129.6, " far"], [129.6, 129.98, " below."]]}, {"start": 141.06, "end": 145.2, "text": "The clip shows a daytime eruption, a column of ash rising over the slope.", "words": [[141.06, 141.26, " The"], [141.26, 141.42, " clip"], [141.42, 141.64, " shows"], [141.64, 141.86, " a"], [141.86, 142.18, " daytime"], [142.18, 142.64, " eruption,"], [143.12, 143.38, " a"], [143.38, 143.58, " column"], [143.58, 143.78, " of"], [143.78, 144.06, " ash"], [144.06, 144.48, " rising"], [144.48, 144.76, " over"], [144.76, 144.98, " the"], [144.98, 145.2, " slope."]]}, {"start": 145.84, "end": 149.02, "text": "Fuego in Guatemala is almost constantly active.", "words": [[145.84, 146.26, " Fuego"], [146.26, 146.46, " in"], [146.46, 147.02, " Guatemala"], [147.02, 147.46, " is"], [147.46, 147.96, " almost"], [147.96, 148.52, " constantly"], [148.52, 149.02, " active."]]}, {"start": 149.6, "end": 153.38, "text": "A small explosion leaves the crater every 15 to 20 minutes.", "words": [[149.6, 149.76, " A"], [149.76, 150.08, " small"], [150.08, 150.7, " explosion"], [150.7, 151.06, " leaves"], [151.06, 151.32, " the"], [151.32, 151.5, " crater"], [151.5, 151.96, " every"], [151.96, 152.48, " 15"], [152.48, 152.64, " to"], [152.64, 152.9, " 20"], [152.9, 153.38, " minutes."]]}, {"start": 153.96, "end": 159.28, "text": "At night, the crater glows red, as in this photograph from November 2017, while", "words": [[153.96, 154.2, " At"], [154.2, 154.42, " night,"], [154.5, 154.68, " the"], [154.68, 154.88, " crater"], [154.88, 155.3, " glows"], [155.3, 155.66, " red,"], [156.06, 156.18, " as"], [156.18, 156.4, " in"], [156.4, 156.6, " this"], [156.6, 157.04, " photograph"], [157.04, 157.24, " from"], [157.24, 157.64, " November"], [157.64, 158.58, " 2017,"], [159.04, 159.28, " while"]]}, {"start": 159.28, "end": 163.9, "text": "larger eruptions, over 80 since 1999, are much rarer.", "words": [[159.28, 159.64, " larger"], [159.64, 160.28, " eruptions,"], [160.52, 160.8, " over"], [160.8, 161.02, " 80"], [161.02, 161.3, " since"], [161.3, 162.12, " 1999,"], [162.6, 162.78, " are"], [162.78, 163.1, " much"], [163.1, 163.9, " rarer."]]}, {"start": 164.18, "end": 169.98, "text": "A day after the eruption of the 31st of January 2018, the Landsat 8 satellite", "words": [[164.18, 164.32, " A"], [164.32, 164.44, " day"], [164.44, 164.72, " after"], [164.72, 164.92, " the"], [164.92, 165.28, " eruption"], [165.28, 165.48, " of"], [165.48, 165.64, " the"], [165.64, 166.32, " 31st"], [166.32, 166.46, " of"], [166.46, 167.08, " January"], [167.08, 168.02, " 2018,"], [168.54, 168.7, " the"], [168.7, 169.14, " Landsat"], [169.14, 169.4, " 8"], [169.4, 169.98, " satellite"]]}, {"start": 169.98, "end": 172.94, "text": "photographed a plume of ash trailing from the volcano.", "words": [[169.98, 170.76, " photographed"], [170.76, 171.04, " a"], [171.04, 171.24, " plume"], [171.24, 171.4, " of"], [171.4, 171.7, " ash"], [171.7, 172.12, " trailing"], [172.12, 172.32, " from"], [172.32, 172.48, " the"], [172.48, 172.94, " volcano."]]}, {"start": 184.48, "end": 187.7, "text": "This clip shows a viewpoint with a shelter on the edge, and", "words": [[184.48, 184.76, " This"], [184.76, 185.06, " clip"], [185.06, 185.32, " shows"], [185.32, 185.48, " a"], [185.48, 185.78, " viewpoint"], [185.78, 186.08, " with"], [186.08, 186.28, " a"], [186.28, 186.52, " shelter"], [186.52, 186.7, " on"], [186.7, 186.88, " the"], [186.88, 187.18, " edge,"], [187.42, 187.7, " and"]]}, {"start": 187.7, "end": 190.2, "text": "then a single slope of the canyon filmed from above.", "words": [[187.7, 187.86, " then"], [187.86, 188.04, " a"], [188.04, 188.4, " single"], [188.4, 188.62, " slope"], [188.62, 188.78, " of"], [188.78, 188.98, " the"], [188.98, 189.2, " canyon"], [189.2, 189.6, " filmed"], [189.6, 189.84, " from"], [189.84, 190.2, " above."]]}, {"start": 190.82, "end": 193.02, "text": "But Copper Canyon is not one canyon.", "words": [[190.82, 191.1, " But"], [191.1, 191.38, " Copper"], [191.38, 191.8, " Canyon"], [191.8, 192.12, " is"], [192.12, 192.4, " not"], [192.4, 192.6, " one"], [192.6, 193.02, " canyon."]]}, {"start": 193.58, "end": 196.74, "text": "It is a system of six canyons cut by six rivers,", "words": [[193.58, 193.7, " It"], [193.7, 193.98, " is"], [193.98, 194.08, " a"], [194.08, 194.4, " system"], [194.4, 194.68, " of"], [194.68, 194.98, " six"], [194.98, 195.4, " canyons"], [195.4, 195.72, " cut"], [195.72, 195.98, " by"], [195.98, 196.26, " six"], [196.26, 196.74, " rivers,"]]}, {"start": 197.12, "end": 201.54, "text": "covering 65,000 square kilometers in the Sierra Madre Occidental.", "words": [[197.12, 197.48, " covering"], [197.48, 198.04, " 65"], [198.04, 198.72, ",000"], [198.72, 199.06, " square"], [199.06, 199.6, " kilometers"], [199.6, 200.06, " in"], [200.06, 200.26, " the"], [200.26, 200.52, " Sierra"], [200.52, 200.94, " Madre"], [200.94, 201.54, " Occidental."]]}, {"start": 202.22, "end": 204.52, "text": "From above, it looks like a maze of ridges and", "words": [[202.22, 202.46, " From"], [202.46, 202.76, " above,"], [202.82, 202.9, " it"], [202.9, 203.12, " looks"], [203.12, 203.36, " like"], [203.36, 203.5, " a"], [203.5, 203.72, " maze"], [203.72, 203.96, " of"], [203.96, 204.3, " ridges"], [204.3, 204.52, " and"]]}, {"start": 204.52, "end": 207.28, "text": "gorges that stretches all the way to the horizon.", "words": [[204.52, 204.98, " gorges"], [204.98, 205.5, " that"], [205.5, 205.9, " stretches"], [205.9, 206.28, " all"], [206.28, 206.42, " the"], [206.42, 206.56, " way"], [206.56, 206.72, " to"], [206.72, 206.86, " the"], [206.86, 207.28, " horizon."]]}, {"start": 218.75, "end": 220.49, "text": "From the air, as in the clip,", "words": [[218.75, 218.95, " From"], [218.95, 219.19, " the"], [219.19, 219.45, " air,"], [219.73, 219.95, " as"], [219.95, 220.11, " in"], [220.11, 220.31, " the"], [220.31, 220.49, " clip,"]]}, {"start": 220.49, "end": 224.63, "text": "Black Rock City looks like an orderly pattern of streets in an empty desert.", "words": [[220.49, 221.03, " Black"], [221.03, 221.29, " Rock"], [221.29, 221.57, " City"], [221.57, 221.87, " looks"], [221.87, 222.11, " like"], [222.11, 222.33, " an"], [222.33, 222.69, " orderly"], [222.69, 223.01, " pattern"], [223.01, 223.27, " of"], [223.27, 223.53, " streets"], [223.53, 223.77, " in"], [223.77, 223.99, " an"], [223.99, 224.19, " empty"], [224.19, 224.63, " desert."]]}, {"start": 225.33, "end": 229.83, "text": "In 2019, it had 78,850 participants,", "words": [[225.33, 225.49, " In"], [225.49, 226.33, " 2019,"], [226.71, 226.79, " it"], [226.79, 227.03, " had"], [227.03, 227.79, " 78"], [227.79, 229.13, ",850"], [229.13, 229.83, " participants,"]]}, {"start": 230.33, "end": 234.63, "text": "over nine days leading up to Labor Day, in the Black Rock Desert in Nevada.", "words": [[230.33, 230.61, " over"], [230.61, 230.89, " nine"], [230.89, 231.31, " days"], [231.31, 231.61, " leading"], [231.61, 231.85, " up"], [231.85, 232.03, " to"], [232.03, 232.31, " Labor"], [232.31, 232.67, " Day,"], [232.97, 233.11, " in"], [233.11, 233.23, " the"], [233.23, 233.53, " Black"], [233.53, 233.75, " Rock"], [233.75, 234.11, " Desert"], [234.11, 234.31, " in"], [234.31, 234.63, " Nevada."]]}, {"start": 235.35, "end": 237.09, "text": "On the ground, the picture is different.", "words": [[235.35, 235.51, " On"], [235.51, 235.69, " the"], [235.69, 235.93, " ground,"], [236.05, 236.13, " the"], [236.13, 236.43, " picture"], [236.43, 236.71, " is"], [236.71, 237.09, " different."]]}, {"start": 237.61, "end": 241.67, "text": "Dust hangs in the air, and the city is seen from the saddle of a bicycle,", "words": [[237.61, 237.95, " Dust"], [237.95, 238.33, " hangs"], [238.33, 238.55, " in"], [238.55, 238.69, " the"], [238.69, 238.97, " air,"], [239.29, 239.43, " and"], [239.43, 239.61, " the"], [239.61, 239.79, " city"], [239.79, 240.07, " is"], [240.07, 240.27, " seen"], [240.27, 240.47, " from"], [240.47, 240.71, " the"], [240.71, 240.93, " saddle"], [240.93, 241.13, " of"], [241.13, 241.25, " a"], [241.25, 241.67, " bicycle,"]]}, {"start": 242.11, "end": 244.09, "text": "as in this photograph from 2012.", "words": [[242.11, 242.29, " as"], [242.29, 242.45, " in"], [242.45, 242.69, " this"], [242.69, 243.17, " photograph"], [243.17, 243.43, " from"], [243.43, 244.09, " 2012."]]}, {"start": 255.45, "end": 258.23, "text": "The clip shows a branch in the foreground with the canyon blurred", "words": [[255.45, 255.67, " The"], [255.67, 255.85, " clip"], [255.85, 256.09, " shows"], [256.09, 256.31, " a"], [256.31, 256.51, " branch"], [256.51, 256.67, " in"], [256.67, 256.79, " the"], [256.79, 257.19, " foreground"], [257.19, 257.41, " with"], [257.41, 257.63, " the"], [257.63, 257.93, " canyon"], [257.93, 258.23, " blurred"]]}, {"start": 258.23, "end": 260.57, "text": "behind it, then a hazy wide view.", "words": [[258.23, 258.61, " behind"], [258.61, 258.83, " it,"], [259.21, 259.39, " then"], [259.39, 259.59, " a"], [259.59, 259.93, " hazy"], [259.93, 260.25, " wide"], [260.25, 260.57, " view."]]}, {"start": 260.96, "end": 266.07, "text": "The Grand Canyon is 277 miles, 446 kilometers,", "words": [[260.96, 261.25, " The"], [261.25, 261.61, " Grand"], [261.61, 262.01, " Canyon"], [262.01, 262.31, " is"], [262.31, 263.43, " 277"], [263.43, 264.03, " miles,"], [264.45, 265.35, " 446"], [265.35, 266.07, " kilometers,"]]}, {"start": 266.55, "end": 270.01, "text": "long, up to 18 miles wide, and over a mile deep.", "words": [[266.55, 266.93, " long,"], [267.15, 267.33, " up"], [267.33, 267.45, " to"], [267.45, 267.89, " 18"], [267.89, 268.25, " miles"], [268.25, 268.63, " wide,"], [268.95, 269.13, " and"], [269.13, 269.35, " over"], [269.35, 269.49, " a"], [269.49, 269.65, " mile"], [269.65, 270.01, " deep."]]}, {"start": 270.55, "end": 271.83, "text": "On the Bright Angel Trail,", "words": [[270.55, 270.75, " On"], [270.75, 270.93, " the"], [270.93, 271.15, " Bright"], [271.15, 271.43, " Angel"], [271.43, 271.83, " Trail,"]]}, {"start": 272.23, "end": 275.71, "text": "the path is only a thin line of switchbacks down the canyon wall.", "words": [[272.23, 272.37, " the"], [272.37, 272.65, " path"], [272.65, 272.91, " is"], [272.91, 273.17, " only"], [273.17, 273.41, " a"], [273.41, 273.57, " thin"], [273.57, 273.81, " line"], [273.81, 274.01, " of"], [274.01, 274.49, " switchbacks"], [274.49, 274.83, " down"], [274.83, 275.01, " the"], [275.01, 275.35, " canyon"], [275.35, 275.71, " wall."]]}, {"start": 276.35, "end": 279.07, "text": "And at sunset, a single hiker shows the scale,", "words": [[276.35, 276.45, " And"], [276.45, 276.67, " at"], [276.67, 277.07, " sunset,"], [277.33, 277.49, " a"], [277.49, 277.81, " single"], [277.81, 278.19, " hiker"], [278.19, 278.47, " shows"], [278.47, 278.75, " the"], [278.75, 279.07, " scale,"]]}, {"start": 279.43, "end": 281.75, "text": "while the rock temples below catch the last light.", "words": [[279.43, 279.59, " while"], [279.59, 279.79, " the"], [279.79, 279.99, " rock"], [279.99, 280.31, " temples"], [280.31, 280.71, " below"], [280.71, 281.01, " catch"], [281.01, 281.25, " the"], [281.25, 281.51, " last"], [281.51, 281.75, " light."]]}, {"start": 293.24, "end": 295.76, "text": "The clip begins with close ups of leaves, and", "words": [[293.24, 293.44, " The"], [293.44, 293.62, " clip"], [293.62, 294.02, " begins"], [294.02, 294.3, " with"], [294.3, 294.54, " close"], [294.54, 294.66, " ups"], [294.66, 294.88, " of"], [294.88, 295.18, " leaves,"], [295.62, 295.76, " and"]]}, {"start": 295.76, "end": 298.24, "text": "then shows two volcanoes far across the lake.", "words": [[295.76, 295.98, " then"], [295.98, 296.2, " shows"], [296.2, 296.5, " two"], [296.5, 296.98, " volcanoes"], [296.98, 297.4, " far"], [297.4, 297.76, " across"], [297.76, 297.94, " the"], [297.94, 298.24, " lake."]]}, {"start": 298.9, "end": 301.74, "text": "Ometepe is one island built from two volcanoes,", "words": [[298.9, 299.5, " Ometepe"], [299.5, 299.72, " is"], [299.72, 299.98, " one"], [299.98, 300.36, " island"], [300.36, 300.62, " built"], [300.62, 300.86, " from"], [300.86, 301.14, " two"], [301.14, 301.74, " volcanoes,"]]}, {"start": 302.3, "end": 305.56, "text": "Concepcion and Maderas, joined by a low isthmus.", "words": [[302.3, 302.9, " Concepcion"], [302.9, 303.12, " and"], [303.12, 303.68, " Maderas,"], [304.1, 304.38, " joined"], [304.38, 304.64, " by"], [304.64, 304.8, " a"], [304.8, 304.98, " low"], [304.98, 305.56, " isthmus."]]}, {"start": 306.0, "end": 309.32, "text": "It is 31 kilometers long and 5 to 10 wide.", "words": [[306.0, 306.12, " It"], [306.12, 306.38, " is"], [306.38, 306.86, " 31"], [306.86, 307.44, " kilometers"], [307.44, 307.94, " long"], [307.94, 308.18, " and"], [308.18, 308.5, " 5"], [308.5, 308.66, " to"], [308.66, 308.88, " 10"], [308.88, 309.32, " wide."]]}, {"start": 310.04, "end": 313.26, "text": "Concepcion is an active volcano with a symmetrical cone,", "words": [[310.04, 310.64, " Concepcion"], [310.64, 310.96, " is"], [310.96, 311.14, " an"], [311.14, 311.44, " active"], [311.44, 312.02, " volcano"], [312.02, 312.26, " with"], [312.26, 312.38, " a"], [312.38, 312.84, " symmetrical"], [312.84, 313.26, " cone,"]]}, {"start": 313.78, "end": 316.18, "text": "and its base is 16 kilometers across.", "words": [[313.78, 313.88, " and"], [313.88, 314.04, " its"], [314.04, 314.34, " base"], [314.34, 314.64, " is"], [314.64, 315.16, " 16"], [315.16, 315.7, " kilometers"], [315.7, 316.18, " across."]]}, {"start": 316.88, "end": 320.28, "text": "Its slopes are covered in dense green vegetation, and", "words": [[316.88, 317.1, " Its"], [317.1, 317.36, " slopes"], [317.36, 317.66, " are"], [317.66, 317.92, " covered"], [317.92, 318.22, " in"], [318.22, 318.48, " dense"], [318.48, 318.86, " green"], [318.86, 319.52, " vegetation,"], [320.1, 320.28, " and"]]}, {"start": 320.28, "end": 322.38, "text": "higher up the ridge disappears into cloud.", "words": [[320.28, 320.5, " higher"], [320.5, 320.7, " up"], [320.7, 320.9, " the"], [320.9, 321.18, " ridge"], [321.18, 321.76, " disappears"], [321.76, 322.06, " into"], [322.06, 322.38, " cloud."]]}]}